        "original_id": "051c6c27-b62a-53eb-9eda-ca48bcf5c9a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donald Fagen, Lauren Laverne, Walter Becker\n- Organizations: Steely Dan, BBC Radio 6\n- Works: \"Show Biz Kids\", \"Silver Eye\", \"Anymore\"\n- Roles: musician, singer, keyboardist, radio DJ, model, television presenter, author, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Donald Fagen was born on January 10, 1948, and he is an American musician.\n- Donald Fagen is best known as the co-founder, lead singer, and keyboardist of Steely Dan.\n- Lauren Laverne was born Lauren Cecilia Fisher, née Gofton, on 28 April 1978, and she is an English radio DJ, model, television presenter, author, singer, and comedian.\n- \"Show Biz Kids\" is a song composed by Walter Becker and Donald Fagen and performed by Steely Dan.\n- On 23 January 2017, the first single from the album \"Silver Eye\", \"Anymore\", was released to digital music retailers after premiering on Lauren Laverne's BBC Radio 6 show.",
